  "comments": "Instruction on the Buddha nature, without direct citations of the Ratnagotravibh\u0101ga (ID:3749).\r\nDiscussed in [FUFWUVQQ] and translated on pp. 310-318.\r\n\r\nThe text ends with the history of the transmission (lo rgyus) of the teaching of the Ratnagotravibh\u0101ga (ID:3749) along with the Dharmadharmat\u0101vibha\u1e45ga (ID:5634). The list, which does not include rNgog Blo ldan shes rab (ID:3786), ends with Ze'u Chos kyi rgyal mtshan (ID:6458), preceded by sKyo ston (ID:4052) - considered to be the author of the present work. See [FUFWUVQQ]: 305 and 317-318 and [BAQ9MH4T]: 45-47.",
